===Etymology===
From {{der|mzs|pt|vai}}, from {{der|mzs|roa-opt|vai}}, and also the third-person singular present indicative inflection of {{m|pt|ir}}. Sense 2 is a {{semantic loan|mzs|yue|去|nocap=1}}.

