# to [[go]]
#: {{uxi|mzs|Êle nádi '''vai'''|He will not '''go'''}}
#: {{uxi|mzs|Já '''vai''' sim falâ co iou|He '''left''' without talking to me}}
# {{lb|mzs|before a verb}} to [[go]] [[in order to]] do something
#: {{ux|mzs|Iou '''vai''' olâ si têm|I'll see if there is any|lit=I '''go''' to see if there is}}
